{meta title='Go'/}
<p class="nt-lead">A go position from a game record in <a href="https://www.red-bean.com/sgf/">SGF</a>,
the Smart Game Format: the board of 9, 13 or 19 lines with its star points and coordinates, the
stones set up, then the moves played out - a group without liberties is taken off the board, as
the rules take it - the last move ringed or every move numbered. Labels and marks of a diagram
are drawn too.</p>

<p class="nt-tag">Written <code>{open/}go '(;SZ[9]AB[cc];W[gg])'/{close/}</code> or with the record between the
tags; <code>numbers</code>, <code>move=</code>, <code>plain</code>, <code>size=</code>.</p>

{examples/}
